\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Lord, I hear of showers of blessing 
\par Thou art scattering, full and free;
\par Showers, the thirsty land refreshing;
\par Let some drops now fall on me.
\par                                     Even me.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Pass me not, O gracious Father,
\par Sinful though my heart may be;
\par Thou might'st leave me, but the rather
\par Let Thy mercy light on me.
\par                                     Even me.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Pass me not, O tender Saviour;
\par Let me love and cling to Thee;
\par I am longing for Thy favour;\tab\tab 
\par Whilst Thou'rt calling, O call me.
\par                                     Even me.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Pass me not, O mighty spirit,
\par Thou canst make the blind to see;
\par Withness of the Saviour's merit,
\par Speak the word of power to me.
\par                                    Even me. 
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Love of God so pure and changeless,
\par Blood of Christ so rich, so free,
\par Grace of God so strong and boundless,
\par Magnify it all in me
\par                                Even me.
\par                      
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

